  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#CoCreateDESIGN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of #cocreateDESIGN FESTIVAL-2019 is to identify city challenges that can be linked to the creativity of entrepreneurs through design thinking. The kick-off will be this event by creating a location and event space to meet and exchange ideas through the methodology of design-thinking in the resilience areas identified by the City of Cape Town. Besides entrepreneurs, city planners and design thinkers will be invited. The promotion of design thinking aims to introduce it as a crucial methodology to enable change and provide solutions for local problem-solving. This initiative supports entrepreneurship in the creative industries by harnessing their innovative vision and creativity. A strategy is being developed to offer continuous support to local entrepreneurs through Masterclasses scheduled throughout 2019. Specific regions targeted include Cape Town, with Durban and Johannesburg also being encouraged to participate.</narrative>
  </description>
